message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "PSEyes — timelapse camera app for Sony PS Eye (PS3)"
abstract: >-
  Windows application for capturing timelapse with the Sony PlayStation Eye (PS3)
  camera. Live preview via PyQt6 and OpenCV/DirectShow, interval JPEG frame capture,
  and MP4 (H.264) assembly with ffmpeg. Includes PS Eye driver repair scripts for
  Windows error code 10 (WinUSB) and automatic camera recovery.
type: software
